lan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Marines Invasion will give you hours of colorful, fun gameplay in this epic real-time strategy space odyssey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Prepare to take off, soldier! The galaxy needs your strategy! Prove your RTS expertise, explore an entire galaxy and defend it from a threatening invasion.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Indonesian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187920/dcfc3b5c11cee5c39aac26abbfd0985a42de6aaa/header.jpg?t=1778514311", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187920/1507e5309ff07c940f7ddbb913d371feafcd1ca6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778514311", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187920/1507e5309ff07c940f7ddbb913d371feafcd1ca6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778514311", "website": "https://www.ironmarines.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 compliant with 512MB of video RAM.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ironhide Game Studio"], "publishers": ["Ironhide Game Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 2428080, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [783283], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy